{"id":"3620ec236cd1a2dc","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-schnorr-trivial-ce-wtt-incomplete.md","title":"可枚举Schnorr平凡集不具wtt完备性","display":"thm-schnorr-trivial-ce-wtt-incomplete — 可枚举Schnorr平凡集不具wtt完备性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-schnorr-trivial-ce-wtt-incomplete","aliases":["43-thm-schnorr-trivial-ce-wtt-incomplete"],"display":"thm-schnorr-trivial-ce-wtt-incomplete — 可枚举Schnorr平凡集不具wtt完备性","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-wtt]]","[[43-df-jump]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Thm.16.3.10, printed p.498 / PDF p.518; proof printed pp.498–500 / PDF pp.518–520","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-schnorr-trivial-ce-wtt-incomplete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-schnorr-trivial-ce-wtt-incomplete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schnorr-trivial-ce-wtt-incomplete — 可枚举Schnorr平凡集不具wtt完备性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84713a230dd071da\" href=\"?note=84713a230dd071da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-trivial\">43-df-schnorr-trivial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"01ea56c49b64bbfd\" href=\"?note=01ea56c49b64bbfd\" title=\"43-df-wtt\">43-df-wtt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Thm.16.3.10, printed p.498 / PDF p.518; proof printed pp.498–500 / PDF pp.518–520"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01ea56c49b64bbfd\" href=\"?note=01ea56c49b64bbfd\" title=\"43-df-wtt\">43-df-wtt</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"84713a230dd071da\" href=\"?note=84713a230dd071da\" title=\"43-df-schnorr-trivial\">43-df-schnorr-trivial</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(A)\\Rightarrow\\varnothing&#39;\\not\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\land\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}(A)\\Rightarrow\\varnothing&#39;\\not\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>必须保留c.e.假设；此结论与Turing完备的c.e. Schnorr平凡集存在并不冲突，因为wtt归约额外要求统一可计算的查询使用界。陈述已核对，未完整重证书中的构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorr-trivial","status":"resolved","id":"84713a230dd071da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-wtt","status":"resolved","id":"01ea56c49b64bbfd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-wtt]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}$ 见 [[43-df-wtt]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[43-df-jump]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-wtt","status":"resolved","id":"01ea56c49b64bbfd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-ce]]，$\\le_{\\mathrm{wtt}}$ 见 [[43-df-wtt]]，$\\varnothing'$ 见 [[43-df-jump]]，$\\mathrm{SchnorrTrivial}$ 见 [[43-df-schnorr-trivial]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\